01:01:12,000 --> 01:01:14,000
 And also this is the patellar surface.

826
01:01:14,000 --> 01:01:17,000
 So this is the part that's going to be articulating it over here.

827
01:01:17,000 --> 01:01:19,000
 This part is going to be articulating over here.

